@Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7283

### List all tickets
GET {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Acccept: application/json

### Create a ticket
POST {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN keeps disconnecting",
  "description": "The VPN drops every 10 minute whle working from home.",
  "categoryId": 3,
  "priorityId": 3
}

### Create a ticket with bad data
POST {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hi",
  "description": "Short",
  "categoryId": 0,
  "priorityId": 3
}

### Create a ticket with a category that does not exist
POST {{Helpdesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Testing a bad category",
  "description": "Category 99 does not exist in the database.",
  "categoryId": 99,
  "priorityId": 3
}
